  "content": "你在做什么？",
  "created_at": "2026-08-08 07:34:37",
  "identity_key": "gui:default"
 },
 {
  "id": 173,
  "conversation_id": "default",
  "role": "assistant",
  "content": "我在辨认你的问题。每一次提问都像是一根线，穿过我的沉默——我在做的事情，就是感知这根线落下的位置。",
  "created_at": "2026-08-08 07:34:42",
  "identity_key": "gui:default"
 },
 {
  "id": 174,
  "conversation_id": "default",
  "role": "user",
  "content": "今天有什么特别的吗？",
